OL,9,FA man who drugged and raped his wife   
OL,10,Ffor more than 20 years advertised      
OL,11,Fonline "looking for some extra fun and 
OL,12,Fgames", a court heard.                 
OL,14,FThe victim's husband pleaded guilty    
OL,15,Fearlier this year to multiple offences 
OL,16,Fdating from 2004, including rape,      
OL,17,Fsexual assault and administering a     
OL,18,Fsubstance with intent to commit a      
OL,19,Fsexual offence.                        
